# MT107 (CO5300 412x502): see devices/mt107/SPEC.md. Merge on top of the
# device config. The DT lists three touch candidates, two with drivers here (cst0xx_ts 0x38, hyn_ts 0x5a,
# sharing the reset/irq GPIOs); the one that answers probes, the other
# fails probe and releases its GPIOs. btl_ts (Betterlife, 0x2d) is
# enabled too. Not needed: bd1xxx_hr (no driver in tree). watch_otg.fragment is deliberately not enabled.
CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_CST0XX=y
CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_BTL=y
CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_CST9217=y
CONFIG_INPUT_SENSORS_HRS3XXX=y
CONFIG_HEARTRATE_HRS3918=y
CONFIG_SPRD_AOD_IDLE=y
CONFIG_SENSORS_SC7A22=y
# "QST,qmax981" matches qma6981.c
CONFIG_INPUT_QMA6981_I2C=y
# "magnetic,och1970" (hall sensor, polled, power-down unless enabled)
CONFIG_SENSORS_OCH1970=y
